[I] The Galène videoconference server

[T] Galene is a videoconferencing server that is easy to deploy and requires
[T] moderate server resources. It is described at <https://galene.org>.

[U] https://galene.org/

[A] Juliusz Chroboczek <jch@irif.fr>
[M] NoTag <notag@t2sde.org>

[C] extra/network
[F] CROSS
[R] + arm arm64 loongarch64 mips mips64 powerpc64 riscv64 s390x x86 x86-64

[L] MIT
[V] 1.2.2

[D] e9847af159eb98f33cbf72e3a112da78fc1e0d116bc0e0bc74caf525 galene-1.2.2.tar.gz https://github.com/jech/galene/archive/galene-1.2.2/

. $base/package/*/*/go-conf.in

hook_add postmake 5 "cp galene $root/$bindir"
